.TH "RPMSORT" "1" "2026-03-06" "RPM 6.0.1"
.PP
.SH "نام (NAME)"
rpmsort \- Sort input by RPM Package Manager (RPM) versioning
.PP
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBrpmsort\fR [ \fIFILE\fR .\&.\&.\& ]
.PP
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
\fBrpmsort\fR(1) sorts the content of the input files, and writes a sorted list
to standard out - like \fBsort\fR(1), but aware of RPM versioning.\&
.PP
.SH ARGUMENTS
\fIFILE\fR
.RS 4
A text-file containing lines to sort.\& If \fIFILE\fR is omitted or \fB-\fR
given, data is read from standard in and written to standard out.\&
.PP
.RE
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
\fBrpmsort\fR has no options.\&
.PP
.SH "وضعیت خروج (EXIT STATUS)"
On success, 0 is returned, a nonzero failure code otherwise.\&
.PP
.SH "مثال‌ها (EXAMPLES)"
\fBecho -e '\&rpm-4.\&18.\&0-3.\&fc38.\&x86_64\enrpm-4.\&18.\&0-1.\&fc38.\&x86_64'\& | rpmsort\fR
.RS 4
.nf
.RS 4
rpm-4\&.18\&.0-1\&.fc38\&.x86_64
rpm-4\&.18\&.0-3\&.fc38\&.x86_64
.fi
.RE
.PP
.RE
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
\fBrpm-version\fR(7)
